From 5495a5359a5bdf7c8c6d1bbed1295a66715d6fc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:27:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 34/46] pomera_dm250: board, config and driver changes matching
 the author U-Boot

- New board kingjim/pomera_dm250 (TEXT_BASE 0x60200000, bootcmd=sd,
  env in FAT 1:1, no FIT/USB host/fastboot, ums kept).
- rk3126_vop: pulse the dclk reset after the window setup.
- rk3126_lvds: LVDS format from the panel data-mapping; panel and
  backlight through their drivers instead of raw GPIO/PWM writes.
- rk8xx: drop the RK818 charger setup (the board sets the RK818).
- tc3589x: read five GPIO modifier keys as an extra row.

The board C file is still a stub.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
